[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_aghpo")
description = "Goblin sperm possesses remarkable drug-like properties that help goblins keep captured ponygirls under control.
A ponygirl’s first exposure triggers an immense wave of pleasure, inevitably resulting in a powerful orgasm, or even several consecutive orgasms when combined with sexual stimulation. Almost all former ponygirls describe the experience as the most intense pleasure they have ever felt.
Exposure also causes a powerful addiction. Although subsequent doses are rarely as overwhelming as the first, they still act as a potent aphrodisiac and drastically increase the ponygirl’s libido.
Goblins are well aware of these effects and use desire, denial, and sexual frustration as methods of control. They keep their ponygirls addicted but unsatisfied through frequent oral or anal use, offering vaginal sex and orgasm as a reward and withholding all sexual contact as punishment.
Goblins also produce a remarkable quantity of semen with each orgasm. It is common practice to insert a toy after intercourse, keeping the substance inside the ponygirl while her body absorbs it. This leaves her dazed, aroused, and submissive for several hours.
In addition, goblin sperm possesses extraordinarily powerful healing properties. It keeps ponygirls healthy and allows them to endure prolonged nudity, bondage, and exhausting physical labour without becoming ill.
This is why, and most tall-folk would probably rather not know it, goblin sperm is a primary ingredient in many healing potions.
Its ability to preserve muscle tissue is particularly remarkable. Despite having their arms bound tightly and uncomfortably for years, ponygirls suffer remarkably little muscular atrophy. Most freed ponygirls report some initial weakness but regain the use of their arms almost immediately after being released.

— Excerpt from “Ponygirls of the Borderlands: An Essay on Goblins and Their Mounts,” by Scholar Lula of Trisa Academy"
